OL,3,AIndian man sentenced to 19-plus years  
OL,4,Ain plot to assassinate US-based Sikh   
OL,5,Aseparatist leader                      
OL,7,FA federal judge sentenced an Indian man
OL,8,Fto 235 months, more than 19 years, in  
OL,9,Fan attempted plot to kill a leading    
OL,10,FSikh political figure in the US.       
OL,12,FNikhil Gupta, an Indian national,      
OL,13,Fpleaded guilty to murder-for-hire,     
OL,14,Fconspiracy to commit murder-for-hire,  
OL,15,Fand conspiracy to commit money         
OL,16,Flaundering in February. On Friday, the 
OL,17,Fjudge said he likely will be deported  
OL,18,For removed after his sentence.         
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
