OL,3,AIndian man sentenced to 19-plus years  
OL,4,Ain plot to assassinate US-based Sikh   
OL,5,Aseparatist leader                      
OL,7,FUS prosecutors alleged Gupta was       
OL,8,Fdirected by an Indian government       
OL,9,Fofficial to kill Gurpatwant Singh      
OL,10,FPannun, a leading figure of the        
OL,11,FKhalistan movement, which advocates for
OL,12,Fan independent homeland for Sikhs.     
OL,14,FIndia has denied involvement. Its      
OL,15,Fgovernment has accused Pannun of being 
OL,16,Fa terrorist, which he denies.          
